# Delivered source masters: originals he drops in to be converted. They are
# large (two of the October SVGs were a 30MB base64 raster in a vector wrapper)
# and the site never serves them, only the WebP derived from them. Keep them on
# disk, out of git history, where they cannot be committed by accident.
assets/img/work/*.png
assets/img/work/*.svg
assets/img/work/*.zip
assets/img/*.jpeg
assets/img/*.jpg
Claude outputs/
